  <para style="h">Ivyahishuwe</para>
  <para style="toc1">Igitabu c’Ivyahishuwe</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ivyahishuwe</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ivy</para>
  <para style="mt2">Igitabu</para>
  <para style="mt1">c’Ivyahishuwe</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="s1">Intangamarara n’indamukanyo</para>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Iki gitabu kidonda ivyahishuwe na Yesu Kristo, ivyo Imana yamuhaye kugira ngo yereke abakozi biwe ibigiye gushika. Na we yabimenyekanishije mu kurungika umumarayika wiwe ku mukozi wiwe Yohana, <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />na we ashingira intahe ivyo yabonye vyose bijanye n’ijambo ry’Imana n’intahe ya Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Hahiriwe uwusoma aya majambo y’ubuvugishwa, kandi hahiriwe abayumva bakayashirako umutima, kuko igihe kiri hafi.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Jewe Yohana,</para>
  <para style="po" vid="REV 1:4">Ndabandikiye mwebwe abo mu mashengero indwi yo muri Aziya:</para>
  <para style="po" vid="REV 1:4">Ubuntu n’amahoro biva ku wuriho, uwamyeho kandi agira aze, no ku mpwemu indwi ziri imbere y’intebe y’inganji yiwe, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />no kuri Yesu Kristo we cabona co kwizigirwa, imfura mu bapfuye, umutware aganza abami bo kw’isi bose, bibane namwe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 1:5" />
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">Icubahiro cose kibe ic’uwadukunze, akatubohora mu vyaha vyacu abanje gusesa amaraso yiwe. <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />Yatugize ubwami bw’abaherezi bo gukorera Imana ari yo Se. Icubahiro n’ububasha bibe ivyayo ibihe vyose! Amen.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />“Ehe azananye n’ibicu,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Daniyeli 7:13</ref></char></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">kandi “amaso yose azomubona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 1:7">n’abamucumise bazomubona,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 1:7">kandi isi yose “izoboroga ku bwiwe.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zakariya 12:10</ref></char></char></note></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 1:7">Nibibe gutyo, Amen.<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />“Ndi Alufa na Omega, Intango n’Iherezo,” ni ko Umwami Imana avuze, “uwuriho, uwamyeho kandi agira aze, Mushoboravyose.”<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Yohana yerekwa Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Jewe Yohana, mwene So mfatanije namwe mu mibabaro, mu Bwami bw’Imana no mu kwihangana, ivyo duhamagarirwa muri Yesu, nari najanywe mw’izinga ryitwa Patimo mporwa ijambo ry’Imana no gushingira intahe Yesu. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Maze ku musi w’Umwami Imana, ndi muri Mpwemu, numva ijwi rivugira inyuma yanje rimeze nk’iry’inzamba isamirana, <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />riti: <char style="wj">“Wandike mu gitabu ivyo ubona vyose maze ubirungikire amashengero indwi mu bisagara vya Efeso, Simuruna, Perugamo, Tuwatira, Sarudi, Filadelufiya, na Lawodikiya.”</char><verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Mpindukiye ngo ndabe uwuriko aramvugisha, nca mbona ibiterekwako amatara indwi bikozwe mu nzahabu, <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />kandi hagati muri vyo hari hahagaze uwusa n’Umwana w’Umuntu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Daniyeli 7:13</ref></char></char></note> yambaye ikanzu ishika ku birenge, akenyeje umukanda w’inzahabu mu gikiriza. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Umushatsi wiwe warera derere; amaso yiwe yasa n’imbeya z’umuriro. <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />Ibirenge vyiwe vyasa n’umwakaka wavugutiwe mw’itanure, ijwi ryiwe na ryo ryari rimeze nk’amazi menshi asuma. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Mu kuboko kwiwe kw’i buryo yari afise inyenyeri indwi, kandi mu kanwa kiwe havamwo inkota y’ubugi bubiri ikarishe. Mu maso hiwe harakayangana nk’izuba ryo ku murango.<verse eid="REV 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Ndamubonye nca nikubita imbere y’ibirenge vyiwe nk’uwupfuye. Ariko aca anshirako ikiganza c’i buryo ambarira ati: <char style="wj">“Ntutinye. Ndi Uwa Mbere kandi ndi Uwa Nyuma.</char> <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" /><char style="wj">Ndi Uwuriho, nari narapfuye none ndi muzima ibihe vyose. Kandi mfise urupfunguruzo rw’urupfu na kuzimu.</char><verse eid="REV 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />
    <char style="wj">Wandike rero ivyo wabonye vyose, ibiriko biraba n’ibiza gukurikira.</char> <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" /><char style="wj">Iyi ni yo nsiguro y’ibanga ry’inyenyeri indwi wabonye mu kiganza canje, n’igiterekwako amatara gikozwe mu nzahabu: inyenyeri indwi ni abamarayika b’amashengero indwi, ibiterekwako amatara na vyo ni ayo mashengero indwi.</char><verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyandikiwe ishengero ryo muri Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />
    <char style="wj">Wandikire umumarayika w’ishengero ryo muri Efeso uti:</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 2:1" />
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 2:1">
    <char style="wj">Uwufise inyenyeri indwi mu kuboko kw’i buryo kandi agendagenda hagati y’ibiterekwako amatara indwi, aravuga ati:</char><verse eid="REV 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />
    <char style="wj">Ndazi ibikorwa vyawe, ukuruha kwawe, n’ukwihangana kwawe. Ndazi ko utihanganira inkozi z’ibibi, kandi ko wasuzumye abo bose bigira intumwa kandi atari zo, ukamenya ko ari ababeshi.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" /><char style="wj">Wihanganiye imibabaro myinshi ku bw’izina ryanje, ntiwadendebukirwa.</char><verse eid="REV 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />
    <char style="wj">Ariko ico nkugaya ni uko watakaje urukundo rwawe rwa mbere.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" /><char style="wj">Niwibuke aho wavuye ukagwa, maze wihane, usubire ukore ibikorwa wakora ubwa mbere. Niyo utihana, nzoza nkure igiterekwako itara cawe mu kibanza caco.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" /><char style="wj">Ariko hari ico ushimirwa: wanse ibikorwa vy’Abanikolayite, nk’uko nanje ndavyanka.</char><verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />
    <char style="wj">Uwufise amatwi niyumve ico Mpwemu abwira amashengero. Uwuzonesha nzomuha kurya ku vyamwa vyo ku giti c’ubugingo, kiri muri paradizo y’Imana.</char><verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyandikiwe ishengero ry’i Simuruna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />
    <char style="wj">Wandikire umumarayika w’ishengero ry’i Simuruna uti:</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 2:8" />
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 2:8">
    <char style="wj">Uwa mbere akaba n’uwa nyuma, uwapfuye akazuka, aravuga ati.</char><verse eid="REV 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />
    <char style="wj">Ndazi imibabaro yawe, n’ubukene bwawe, ariko uri umutunzi! Ndazi ibitutsi utukwa n’abiyita Abayuda kandi atari bo, ahubwo ari abo mw’isinagogi rya Satani.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" /><char style="wj">Ntuterwe ubwoba n’imibabaro ugiye gucamwo, kuko wa mubi agiye gushira bamwe muri mwebwe mw’ibohero kugira ngo akugerageze. Muzobabazwa imisi cumi. Ariko niwaguma mu bwizigirwa gushika ku gupfa, nzoguha igitsibo c’ubugingo.</char><verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />
    <char style="wj">Uwufise amatwi niyumve ico Mpwemu abwira amashengero. Uwuzonesha nta co urupfu rwa kabiri ruzomugira.</char><verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyandikiwe ishengero ry’i Perugamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />
    <char style="wj">Wandikire umumarayika w’ishengero ry’i Perugamo uti:</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 2:12" />
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 2:12">
    <char style="wj">Uwufise inkota ikarishe, ifise ubugi bubiri, aravuga ati.</char><verse eid="REV 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />
    <char style="wj">Ndazi ko uba mu gisagara Satani afisemwo intebe y’inganji, ariko wumiye kw’izina ryanje. Ntiwamvuyeko no mu gihe ca Antipa, icabona canje c’ukwizigirwa, uwagandaguriwe muri mwebwe, mu gisagara ca Satani.</char><verse eid="REV 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />
    <char style="wj">Ariko ico nkugaya ni uko hari bamwe muri mwebwe bagikurikira inyigisho za Balamu, yigishije Balaki kugwisha Abisirayeli mu vyaha, bakarya ivyaterekerewe ibigirwamana bagakora n’ivyaha vy’ubusambanyi.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" /><char style="wj">Kandi muri mwebwe hariho n’abakurikira inyigisho z’Abanikolayite.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" /><char style="wj">None rero niwihane. Ahandi ho nzoza vuba kukugwanya nitwaje inkota yo mu kanwa kanje.</char><verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />
    <char style="wj">Uwufise amatwi niyumve ico Mpwemu abwira amashengero. Uwuzonesha nzomuha kurya kuri manu yahishijwe. Nzomuha kandi ibuye ryera ryanditseko izina rishasha; nta wuzomenya iryo zina kiretse uwuzohabwa iryo buye.</char><verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyandikiwe ishengero ry’i Tuwatira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />
    <char style="wj">Wandikire umumarayika w’ishengero ry’i Tuwatira uti:</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 2:18" />
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 2:18">
    <char style="wj">Umwana w’Imana, uwufise amaso aca ibibatsi nk’imbeya z’umuriro, akagira n’ibirenge vyakaka nk’umuringa, aravuga ati.</char><verse eid="REV 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />
    <char style="wj">Ndazi ibikorwa vyawe, urukundo rwawe, ukwizera kwawe, ukwitanga kwawe n’ukwihangana kwawe. Ndazi kandi ko ibikorwa vyawe vy’ubu biruta mu bwinshi ivyo wakora mu ntango.</char><verse eid="REV 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />
    <char style="wj">Ariko ico nkugaya ni uko waretse uwo mugore Yezebeli yiyita umuvugishwa, akazimiza abantu banje, akabajana mu busambanyi no mu kurya ivyaterekerewe ibigirwamana.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" /><char style="wj">Namuhaye umwanya ukwiye ngo yihane ariko ntagomba kuva mu ngeso ziwe z’ubusambanyi.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" /><char style="wj">None rero nzomuterera ku buriri bw’imibabaro, kandi n’abasambana na we nzobatera imibabaro myinshi, kiretse bihanye bakareka ibikorwa vyabo bibi.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" /><char style="wj">Nzokwica abana biwe bose. Aho ni ho amashengero yose azomenya ko ndi Imana isuzuma ivyanyegejwe mu mitima no mu vyiyumviro kandi ko nzoha umuntu wese impembo ikwiranye n’ivyo yakoze.</char><verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />
    <char style="wj">Ariko mwebwe abasigaye b’i Tuwatira mutifatanije n’izo nyigisho mbi, kandi mutakurikiye ivyo abantu bise amabanga akomeye ya Satani, ‘Nta wundi mutwaro ndabikoreza,</char> <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" /><char style="wj">uretse kwumira ku co mufise gushika ngarutse.’</char><verse eid="REV 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />
    <char style="wj">Uwuzonesha akabandanya anyumvira gushika kw’iherezo, nzomuha kuganza amahanga.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" /><char style="wj">Azoyatwazanya umukazo, ayamenagure nk’uwumena inkono z’ibumba.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2:9">Zaburi 2:9</ref></char></char></note> <char style="wj">Nzomuha ububasha nahawe na Data,</char> <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" /><char style="wj">kandi nzomuha n’inyenyeri yo mu mutwenzi.</char> <verse eid="REV 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" /><char style="wj">Uwufise amatwi niyumve ico Mpwemu abwira amashengero.</char><verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyandikiwe ishengero ry’i Sarudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />
    <char style="wj">Wandikire umumarayika w’ishengero ry’i Sarudi uti:</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 3:1" />
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 3:1">
    <char style="wj">Uwufise mu biganza impwemu indwi z’Imana n’inyenyeri indwi avuga ati:</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 3:1" />
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 3:1">
    <char style="wj">Ndazi ibikorwa vyawe. Abantu benshi bazi ko uri muzima kandi warapfuye.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" /><char style="wj">Ikangure ukomeze ivyo usigaranye bigikomeye ariko bigiye gupfa, kuko ibikorwa vyawe bidatunganye imbere y’Imana.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" /><char style="wj">Wibuke inyigisho wumvise ukazakira. Uzigendere wongere wihane. Nutikangura, nzoza nk’igisuma kandi ntuzomenya igihe nzokugendera.</char><verse eid="REV 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />
    <char style="wj">Ariko uracafise abantu bakeya i Sarudi batanduje impuzu zabo. Abo bazogendana nanje bambaye imyambaro yera kuko birababereye.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" /><char style="wj">Uwuzonesha nzomwambika imyambaro yera. Sinzokwigera mpanagura izina ryiwe mu gitabu c’ubugingo, ahubwo nzorivuga imbere ya Data n’abamarayika biwe.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" /><char style="wj">Uwufise amatwi niyumve ico Mpwemu abwira amashengero.</char><verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyandikiwe ishengero ry’i Filadelufiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />
    <char style="wj">Wandikire umumarayika w’ishengero ry’i Filadelufiya uti:</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 3:7" />
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 3:7">
    <char style="wj">Uwera kandi uw’ukuri, uwufise urupfunguruzo rwa Dawidi mu kiganza; ico yuguruye nta wushobora kucugara, kandi ico yugaye nta wushobora kucugurura, avuga ati.</char><verse eid="REV 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />
    <char style="wj">Ndazi ibikorwa vyawe. Ehe, nakwugururiye umuryango ata n’umwe ashobora kwugara. Ndazi ko ufise intege nke, ariko wazigamye ijambo ryanje, ntiwanyihakana.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" /><char style="wj">Ehe, nzozana abo mw’isinagogi rya Satani biyita Abayuda kandi atari bo, bapfukame imbere yawe, bamenye ko ndagukunda.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" /><char style="wj">Ko witondeye ibwirizwa ryanje ryo kwihanganira ibikugerageza, nanje nzokurinda ibihe vy’amagorwa bigiye kuza kw’isi yose kugerageza abayibako.</char><verse eid="REV 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />
    <char style="wj">Ehe ndaza vuba. Wumire ku co ufise kugira ngo ntihagire uwugutwara impera yawe.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" /><char style="wj">Uwuzonesha nzomugira inkingi mu rusengero rw’Imana yanje, kandi ntazokwigera ahava. Nzomwandikako izina ry’Imana yanje, hamwe n’iry’igisagara c’Imana yanje, ni co Yerusalemu nshasha, imanuka iva mw’ijuru ku Mana yanje; kandi nzomwandikako izina ryanje rishasha.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" /><char style="wj">Uwufise amatwi niyumve ico Mpwemu abwira amashengero.</char><verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyandikiwe ishengero ry’i Lawodikiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />
    <char style="wj">Wandikire umumarayika w’ishengero ry’i Lawodikiya uti:</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="REV 3:14" />
  <para style="pi1" vid="REV 3:14">
    <char style="wj">Uwitwa Amen, umwizigirwa kandi icabona c’ukuri, uwuganza ivyaremwe n’Imana vyose, avuga ati:</char><verse eid="REV 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />
    <char style="wj">Ndazi ibikorwa vyawe. Ndazi ko udakonje kandi utabize. Ese iyo ukonja canke ukabira!</char> <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" /><char style="wj">Ko uri akazuyazi, udakonje canke ngo ubire, ngira ndakudahwe.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" /><char style="wj">Uvuga ngo uratunze, ufise vyinshi kandi ngo nta co ukenye. Ariko ntuzi ingene uri umugorwa ateye ikigongwe. Uri umukene, urahumye kandi ugenda gusa.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" /><char style="wj">Ni co gituma ndaguhanura ngo ungureko inzahabu zivugutiwe mu muriro kugira ngo ube umutunzi. Ungureko imyambaro yera kugira ngo ufuke ubwambure bwawe buteye isoni, ungureko kandi n’umuti wo gusiga ku maso yawe kugira ngo ushobore kubona.</char><verse eid="REV 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />
    <char style="wj">Uwo nkunda ndamukankamira, nkanamuhana. None rero, gira umwete, wihane.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" /><char style="wj">Ehe mpagaze ku muryango ndiko ndadodora. Uwumva ijwi ryanje akugurura umuryango, ndinjira iwe dusangire.</char><verse eid="REV 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="pi1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />
    <char style="wj">Uwuzonesha nzomuha kwicarana nanje ku ntebe y’inganji, nk’uko nanje nanesheje nkicarana na Data ku ntebe y’inganji yiwe.</char> <verse eid="REV 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" /><char style="wj">Uwufise amatwi niyumve ico Mpwemu abwira amashengero.”</char><verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s1">Intebe y’inganji mw’ijuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Inyuma y’ivyo ndaraba, mbona umuryango wuguruye mw’ijuru. Rya jwi nari numvise ubwa mbere rivuga nk’inzamba, rimbwira riti: <char style="wj">“Duga uze hano, ndakwereke ibigiye kuba inyuma y’ibi.”</char> <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Ako kanya nyene, nca nja muri Mpwemu, mbona intebe y’inganji mw’ijuru, mbona n’uwuyicayeko. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Uwari ayicayeko yasa n’ibuye ry’agaciro ryitwa yasipi hamwe n’iryitwa sarudiyo. Kandi iyo ntebe yari izungurutswe n’umunywamazi usa n’ibuye ry’agaciro ryitwa simaragido. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Iyo ntebe yari ikikujwe n’izindi mirongo ibiri na zine, zicaweko n’abakuru mirongo ibiri na bane bambaye impuzu zera n’ingori z’inzahabu ku mitwe yabo. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Kuri iyo ntebe hava imiravyo, urwamo n’imituragaro. Imbere y’iyo ntebe hari amatara indwi yaka, ari zo mpwemu indwi z’Imana. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Kandi imbere yayo hari igisa n’ikiyaga c’ibiyo kibonerana cane.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Hagati na hagati n’ahakikuje iyo ntebe, hari ibinyabugingo vyuzuye amaso imbere n’inyuma. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Ikinyabugingo ca mbere casa n’intambwe, ica kabiri casa n’impfizi ikiri nto, ica gatatu cari gifise mu maso hasa n’ah’umuntu, ica kane cari kimeze nk’inkona iriko iraguruka. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Kimwekimwe cose muri vyo cari gifise amababa atandatu, cuzuye amaso hose n’imbere muri vyo. Ijoro n’umurango, ntivyahengeshanya kwama bivuga biti:</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">“ ‘Uwera, uwera, uwera,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">ni we Mwami Imana Mushoboravyose,’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 6:3">Yesaya 6:3</ref></char></char></note></para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 4:8">yamyeho, ariho, kandi agira aze.”<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Igihe cose ivyo binyabugingo bihaye icubahiro uwicaye kuri ya ntebe kandi ariho ibihe bidashira, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />ba bakuru mirongo ibiri na bane baca bikubita imbere y’uwicaye kuri ya ntebe, bagahimbaza uwuriho ibihe bidashira, bagashira hasi za ngori zabo imbere ya ya ntebe y’inganji, bavuga bati:<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />“Urabereye, Mwami Imana yacu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">kwakira icubahiro n’ububasha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">kuko ari wewe waremye vyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">ugushaka kwawe ni ko kwatumye bibaho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">biraremwa.”<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s1">Umuzingo w’igitabu n’umwagazi w’intama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Hanyuma mbona umuzingo w’igitabu mu kuboko kw’i buryo kw’uwari yicaye kuri ya ntebe y’inganji. Ico gitabu cari canditseko imbere n’inyuma, gihomesheje ishashara indwi. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Nongera mbona n’umumarayika w’inkomezi asemerera n’ijwi rirenga ati: “Ni nde abereye kumena ibintu indwi bimatanije uwu muzingo w’igitabu no kuwugurura?” <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Ariko mu bo mw’ijuru canke mw’isi canke i kuzimu, ntihaboneka n’umwe ashoboye kuwugurura, canke ngo asome ibiri muri wo. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Nca ndarira cane kuko ata n’umwe abonetse abereye kwugurura uwo muzingo w’igitabu canke ngo asome ibiri muri wo. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Maze umwe muri ba bakuru arambwira ati: “Reka kurira! Ehe, intambwe yo mu muryango wa Yuda, uwukomoka mu muryango wa Dawidi, yaranesheje. Ni we abereye kumena ibintu indwi bimatanije uwo muzingo w’igitabu no kuwugurura.”<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Nuko mbona Umwagazi w’Intama, usa n’uwishwe, uhagaze hambavu ya ya ntebe y’inganji, ukikujwe na vya binyabugingo bine na ba bakuru. Wari ufise amahembe indwi n’amaso indwi. Ayo maso ni zo mpwemu indwi Imana yarungitse mw’isi yose. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Wa mwagazi uraza wakira wa muzingo w’igitabu ugikuye mu minwe y’uwari yicaye kuri ya ntebe y’inganji. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Umaze kuwakira, vya binyabugingo bine na ba bakuru mirongo ibiri na bane baca bikubita imbere yawo. Umwe wese muri bo yari afise inanga, kandi bari bafise inzavya zikozwe mu nzahabu zuzuye ibimota neza, ari yo masengesho y’abera. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Baca baririmba indirimbo nsha, bavuga bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">“Urabereye kwakira uwo muzingo w’igitabu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">no kumena ibiwumatanije,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">kuko wishwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">amaraso yawe agacungurira Imana</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">abantu bavuye mu miryango yose, mu ndimi zose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">mu bwoko bwose no mu mahanga yose.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Wabagize abami n’abaherezi bo gukorera Imana yacu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">kandi bazoganza kw’isi.”<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Nongeye kuraba kandi, nca numva amajwi y’abamarayika ibihumbi n’ibihumbi bakikuje ya ntebe y’inganji, n’aya vya binyabugingo, na ba bakuru, <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />baririmba n’ijwi rirenga bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">“Umwagazi w’intama we yishwe, arabereye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">kwakira ububasha, ubutunzi, ubwenge, inkomezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">icubahiro, ubwiza, n’amashimwe.”<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Hanyuma nca numva amajwi y’ivyaremwe vyose, ivyo mw’ijuru, ivyo kw’isi, ivy’i kuzimu, ivyo mu biyaga n’ibibibamwo, biririmba biti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">“Guhimbazwa n’icubahiro, ubwiza n’ububasha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">ni ivy’uwicaye ku ntebe y’inganji n’Umwagazi w’intama yishwe,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="REV 5:13">ibihe vyose!”<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Vya binyabugingo bine bica bivuga biti: “Amen,” ba bakuru na bo baca bikubita hasi, barahimbaza.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ibimatanije umuzingo w’igitabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Ngize gutya, mbona wa Mwagazi amena ica mbere muri bimwe indwi bimatanije wa muzingo w’igitabu. Nca numva kimwe muri vya binyabugingo kivuze n’ijwi nk’iry’inkuba kiti: “Ingo!” <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Ndavye imbere yanje nca mbona ifarasi yera. Uwayigenderako yari afise umuheto, hanyuma ahabwa urugori, aca ayigenderako nk’uwanesheje kandi agiye kunesha.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Yuguruye ica kabiri, nca numva ikinyabugingo ca kabiri kivuze giti: “Ingo!” <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Haca haza iyindi farasi itukura. Uwayigenderako aca ahabwa ububasha bwo gukura amahoro kw’isi, no gutuma abantu bicana. Aca ahabwa inkota nini.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Yuguruye ica gatatu, nca numva ikinyabugingo ca gatatu kivuze kiti: “Ingo!” Haca haza ifarasi yirabura. Uwayigenderako yari afise iminzane ibiri mu minwe. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Nca numva kimwe muri vya binyabugingo kivuze kiti: “Ingero imwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ikilo 1.</char></note> y’ingano izogurwa impembo y’umusi wose<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’idenariyo 1.</char></note>, ibiro bitatu vya sayiri bizogurwa impembo y’umusi wose. Ariko ntihagire ico mugira amavuta n’umuvinyu.”<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Yuguruye ica kane nca numva ikinyabugingo ca kane kivuze kiti: “Ingo!” <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Haca haza ifarasi isa n’urwatsi rubisi. Uwuyigenderako yitwa Rupfu, uwaje amukurikira na we yitwa Kuzimu. Baca bahabwa ububasha, ku ca kane c’isi, bwo kumarisha abantu inkota, inzara, ingwara, n’ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Yuguruye ica gatanu, nca mbona imishaha y’abishwe bazira ijambo ry’Imana n’ugushinga intahe kwabo, iri musi y’igicaniro. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Basemerera n’ijwi rirenga bati: “Uzogeza ryari, Mwami uganje, uwera kandi uw’ukuri, uzorindira gushika ryari, kugira ngo ucire ababa kw’isi imanza, uhore amaraso yacu?” <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Umwe wese muri bo aca ahabwa ikanzu yera, baca basabwa kurindira ikindi gihe gito, gushika igitigiri ca bene Data, abo bari basangiye gukorera Umwami Yesu, bategerezwa kwicwa nk’uko na bo bishwe, kibanze gikwire.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Yuguruye ica gatandatu, haba nyamugigima. Izuba rica ricura umwijima, risa n’igunira rikozwe mu bwoya bw’impene, ukwezi gutukura nk’amaraso, <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />inyenyeri zo kw’ijuru zikoragurikira kw’isi nk’ivyamwa vy’insukoni bikoroka biva ku giti kinyiganyijwe n’umuyaga w’igihuhusi. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Ijuru rica ririzinga nk’umuzingo w’igitabu bazinze, imisozi n’amazinga vyose bikurwa aho vyahora.<verse eid="REV 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Maze abami bo kw’isi, abahambaye, abasoda bakuru, abatunzi, abakomeye, abagurano n’abidegemvya bose binyegeza mu masenga no mu bitandara vy’amabuye vyo mu misozi. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Bahamagara imisozi n’ibitandara vy’amabuye bavuga bati: “Nimutugweko muduhishe amaso y’uwicaye ku ntebe y’inganji, n’uburake bw’Umwagazi w’intama, <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />kuko umusi uhambaye w’uburake bwabo urashitse, kandi nta wushobora kuwuhangara.”<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s1">Ivy’abantu bashizweko ikimenyetso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Inyuma y’ivyo mbona abamarayika bane bahagaze mu mpande zine z’isi, batangiriye imiyaga ine yo kw’isi, kugira ngo babuze umuyaga guhuhuta kw’isi canke ku kiyaga canke ku biti. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Nca mbona uwundi mumarayika avuye i burasirazuba, afise ikimenyetso c’Imana nzima. Aca arasemerera abwira ba bamarayika bane bahabwa ububasha bwo kwonona isi n’ikiyaga ati: <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />“Ntimwonone isi canke ikiyaga canke ibiti tutarashira ikimenyetso mu ku ruhanga abakoreye Imana yacu.” <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Maze nca ndumva igitigiri c’abashizweko ico kimenyetso; bari ibihumbi ijana na mirongo ine na bine bavuye mu miryango yose ya Isirayeli.<verse eid="REV 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Mu muryango wa Yuda bari ibihumbi cumi na bibiri,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:5">mu wa Reyubeni bari ibihumbi cumi na bibiri,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:5">mu wa Gadi bari ibihumbi cumi na bibiri,<verse eid="REV 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />mu wa Asheri bari ibihumbi cumi na bibiri,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:6">mu wa Nafutali bari ibihumbi cumi na bibiri,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:6">mu wa Manase bari ibihumbi cumi na bibiri,<verse eid="REV 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />mu wa Simeyoni bari ibihumbi cumi na bibiri,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:7">mu wa Lewi bari ibihumbi cumi na bibiri,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:7">mu wa Isakari bari ibihumbi cumi na bibiri,<verse eid="REV 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />mu wa Zabuloni bari ibihumbi cumi na bibiri,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:8">mu wa Yosefu bari ibihumbi cumi na bibiri,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="REV 7:8">mu wa Benyamini bari ibihumbi cumi na bibiri.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abandi isinzi bari bambaye amakanzu yera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Inyuma y’ivyo nca mbona isinzi ry’abantu batoharurika, bavuye mu mahanga yose, mu moko yose no mu ndimi zose, bahagaze imbere ya ya ntebe y’inganji n’imbere ya wa Mwagazi. Bari bambaye amakanzu yera, bafise n’amashami y’ibigazi mu minwe. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />Baca basemerera n’ijwi rirenga bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">“Agakiza ni ak’Imana yacu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">yicaye ku ntebe y’inganji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:10">n’Umwagazi w’intama.”<verse eid="REV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Abamarayika bose bari bahagaze bakikuje ya ntebe y’inganji na ba bakuru mirongo ibiri na bane na vya binyabugingo bine. Baca bikubita hasi bubamye imbere y’intebe y’inganji, basenga Imana <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />bavuga bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">“Amen!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">Guhimbazwa, ubwiza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">ubwenge, amashimwe, icubahiro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">ububasha n’inkomezi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">bibe ivy’Imana yacu ibihe vyose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:12">Amen!”<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Umwe muri ba bakuru aca ambaza ati: “Aba bambaye amakanzu yera ni ba nde kandi bavuye he?”<verse eid="REV 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Nca ndamwishura nti: “Nyakwubahwa, ni wewe wobimenya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:14">Aca avuga ati: “Aba ni abavuye muri rya hamwa rikomeye, bamesuye amakanzu yabo, bayezesha amaraso ya wa Mwagazi. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Ni co gituma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">bahagaze imbere y’intebe y’inganji y’Imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">bayihimbariza mu rusengero ijoro n’umurango,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:15">kandi uwicaye ku ntebe y’inganji</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:15">azobashira mw’ihema ryiwe.<verse eid="REV 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />‘Ntibazoba bagisonza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">kandi ntibazoba bakinyoterwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:16">Izuba ntirizosubira kubakira,’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 49:10">Yesaya 49:10</ref></char></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:16">kandi nta bushuhe buzobica.<verse eid="REV 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />Kuko Umwagazi w’intama ari ku ngoma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">ari we azobabera umwungere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">azobaha ku mazi y’ubugingo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">Yesaya 25:8</ref></char></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 7:17">‘Kandi Imana izobahanagura amosozi yose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 7:17">ku maso yabo.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 49:10">Yesaya 49:10</ref></char></char></note>”<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ikimenyetso c’indwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Yuguruye ikigira indwi, haca haba agacerere mw’ijuru kamara nk’igice c’isaha.<verse eid="REV 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Nca mbona ba bamarayika indwi bahagaze imbere y’Imana bahawe inzamba indwi.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Haca haza uwundi mumarayika afise ico gutuririramwo ibimota neza gikozwe mu nzahabu, ahagarara imbere y’igicaniro; aca ahabwa ibimota neza vyinshi abivanga n’amasengesho y’abera kugira ngo abitange ku gicaniro gikozwe mu nzahabu cari imbere y’intebe y’inganji. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Umwotsi w’ibimota neza n’amasengesho y’abera biraduga bishika imbere y’Imana bivuye mu biganza vya wa mumarayika. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Wa mumarayika aca afata kimwe co gutuririramwo ibimota neza, acuzuza umuriro wo ku gicaniro, agiterera kw’isi; haca humvikana urwamo rw’imituragaro, imiravyo na nyamugigima.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inzamba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Ba bamarayika indwi bafise inzamba baca baritegura kugira ngo bazivuze.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Umumarayika wa mbere avugije inzamba yiwe, urubura n’umuriro bivanze n’amaraso bica bisukwa kw’isi. Maze ica gatatu c’isi, ica gatatu c’ibiti n’ica gatatu c’ivyatsi birasha.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Umumarayika wa kabiri avugije inzamba yiwe, ikintu kimeze nk’umusozi waka umuriro, gitabwa mu kiyaga. Maze ica gatatu c’ikiyaga gica gihinduka amaraso, <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />ica gatatu c’ibiba mu kiyaga bica birapfa, n’ica gatatu c’ubwato burasambuka.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Umumarayika wa gatatu avugije inzamba yiwe, ikinyenyeri kinini caka nk’itara kirakoroka kivuye kw’ijuru, kigwa ku ca gatatu c’inzuzi n’amasoko y’amazi. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Izina ry’ico kinyenyeri ni Mururazi. Maze ica gatatu c’amazi yose aca ahinduka umururazi, kandi abantu benshi banyoye ayo mazi y’umururazi barapfa.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Umumarayika wa kane avugije inzamba yiwe, Imana ica ikubita ica gatatu c’izuba n’ica gatatu c’ukwezi n’ic’inyenyeri maze umuco wavyo uca uhinduka umwijima. Bica bituma ica gatatu c’umusi n’ica gatatu c’ijoro na vyo bihinduka umwijima.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Ndavye kandi, nca numva inkona igurukira kure mu kirere ivuga n’ijwi rirenga iti: “Baragowe, baragowe, baragowe ababa kw’isi ku bw’ibizoba abamarayika batatu ba nyuma nibavuza inzamba!”<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Umumarayika wa gatanu avugije inzamba yiwe, nca mbona inyenyeri ikorokeye hasi ivuye kw’ijuru. Iyo nyenyeri ica ihabwa urupfunguruzo rw’icobo kijana i kuzimu. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Yuguruye ico cobo, haca hapfunduka umwotsi umeze nk’uw’itanure rinini, maze izuba n’ikirere bica bitakaza umuco wavyo kubera uwo mwotsi. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Muri uwo mwotsi haca havamwo inzige zimanuka kw’isi, zihabwa ububasha nk’ubwa sikoropiyo zo kw’isi. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Nuko izo nzige zitegekwa kutonona ivyatsi, ibiterwa canke ibiti, ariko zitegekwa kubabaza ababa kw’isi bose badafise ikimenyetso c’Imana ku ruhanga. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Izo nzige zihabwa ububasha bwo gutoteza abantu amezi atanu, ariko ntizemererwa kubica. Umubabaro zatera wari umeze nk’uwo umuntu agira iyo akomowe na sikoropiyo. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Muri iyo misi abantu bazorondera urupfu ariko ntibazoruronka; bazokwipfuza gupfa, ariko urupfu ruzobahunga.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Izo nzige zari zimeze nk’amafarasi yiteguriye kuja ku rugamba. Ku mitwe zari zambaye igisa n’urugori rw’inzahabu, kandi mu maso hazo hari hameze nk’ah’abantu. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Imishatsi yazo yari imeze nk’iy’abagore, amenyo yazo na yo yari ameze nk’ay’intambwe. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Mu bikiriza zari zambaye ivyuma vyo kuzikingira, kandi amababa yazo yavuza urwamo nk’urw’imikogote myinshi ikwegwa n’amafarasi aja ku rugamba. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Zari zifise imirizo ikomora nk’iya sikoropiyo kandi ububasha bwo kubabaza abantu amezi atanu bwari mu mirizo yazo. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Umwami wazo yari umumarayika w’i kuzimu, izina ryiwe mu Giheburayo ni Abadoni, mu Kigiriki ni Apoluwoni, bisigura Umuranduzi.<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Icago ca mbere kiraheze. Ariko hari bibiri bigiye kuza vuba.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Umumarayika wa gatandatu avugije inzamba yiwe, nca numva ijwi rivuye mu mahembe ane y’inzahabu ari ku gicaniro kiri imbere y’Imana, <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />ribwira wa mumarayika wa gatandatu yari afise inzamba riti: “Rekura abamarayika bane babohewe ku ruzi runini Efurata.” <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Nuko ba bamarayika bane bararekurwa. Bari bateguriwe iyo saha, uwo musi, uko kwezi, uwo mwaka nyene, kugira ngo bice ica gatatu c’abantu bari kw’isi. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Nuko nca mbwirwa ko igitigiri c’abasoda bagwanira ku mafarasi kingana imiliyoni amajana abiri.<verse eid="REV 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Ndiko nderekwa, mbona ayo mafarasi n’abayagenderako. Bari bitwaje inkinzo zitukura, izisa n’ubururu, hamwe n’izisa n’umuhondo. Ayo mafarasi yari afise imitwe nk’iy’intambwe, kandi mu kanwa hayo havayo umuriro, umwotsi n’ibizuku. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Nuko ica gatatu c’abari kw’isi bicwa n’ivyago bitatu: umuriro, umwotsi n’ibizuku vyava mu kanwa k’ayo mafarasi. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Ububasha bw’ayo mafarasi bwari mu kanwa no mu mirizo vyayo; kuko imirizo yayo yari ifise imitwe nk’iy’inzoka kandi yari ifise ububasha bwo gukomeretsa abantu.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Ariko abasigaye batishwe n’ivyo vyago ntibihanye ibikorwa vyabo bibi bakoze n’amaboko yabo; ntibahevye gusenga abadayimoni n’ibigirwamana bikozwe mu nzahabu, mw’ifeza, mu mwakaka, mu mabuye no mu biti, bitabona, bitumva canke ngo bitambuke. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Ntibigeze kandi bihana ubwicanyi, amareba, ubusambanyi n’ubusuma.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ivy’umuzingo w’igitabu mutoya mu minwe y’umumarayika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Hanyuma mbona uwundi mumarayika w’inkomezi yururuka ava mw’ijuru. Yari yambaye igicu, umunywamazi ukaba hejuru y’umutwe wiwe. Mu maso hiwe hari hameze nk’izuba, amaguru yiwe na yo yari ameze nk’inkingi z’umuriro. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Yari afise umuzingo w’igitabu mutoya wuguruye mu kiganza ciwe. Aca ashinga ikirenge ciwe c’i buryo ku kiyaga, ic’i bubamfu agishinga i musozi. <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />Hanyuma aca arasemerera n’ijwi rirenga nk’intambwe yivuga. Asemereye, haca humvikana amajwi y’imituragaro indwi. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Iyo mituragaro indwi imaze kuvuga, nca mfata ikaramu ngo nandike. Ariko nca numva ijwi rivuye mw’ijuru rivuga riti: “Ivyo iyo mituragaro indwi yavuze, ubigire ibanga, ntuvyandike.”<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Wa mumarayika nabona ahagaze ku kiyaga n’i musozi, aca aduza ikiganza ciwe c’i buryo akirabisha kw’ijuru. <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />Aca ararahira mw’izina ry’Imana ibaho ibihe vyose, yaremye amajuru n’ibiyabamwo, isi n’ibiyirimwo n’ibiyaga n’ibibibamwo, ati: “Nta mwanya wo kurindira ugisigaye! <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Ariko umumarayika w’indwi niyavuza inzamba yiwe, imigambi ihishijwe y’Imana izoca ishitswa, nk’uko yayimenyesheje abakozi bayo ari bo bavugishwa na yo.”<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Rya jwi nari numvise rimvugisha rivuye mw’ijuru, rica rirasubira rimbarira riti: “Genda wakire urya muzingo mutoya w’igitabu wuguruye mu minwe y’urya mumarayika ahagaze ku kiyaga n’i musozi.”<verse eid="REV 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Nca ndagenda ndamusaba ngo ampe uwo muzingo mutoya w’igitabu. Aca ambwira ati: “Wakire uwurye. Uzokubera umururazi mu nda, ariko mu kanwa uzogusosera nk’ubuki.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EZK 3:3">Ezekiyeli 3:3</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="REV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Nuko nakira wa muzingo mutoya w’igitabu ndawukuye mu kiganza ca wa mumarayika, nca ndawurya. Mu kanwa wasosa nk’ubuki, ariko maze kuwumira, uca ucika umururazi mu nda. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Hanyuma nca numva ijwi rimbwira riti: “Utegerezwa kuvugishwa kandi ku moko menshi, amahanga menshi, indimi nyinshi n’abami benshi.”<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyabona bibiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Maze mpabwa irenga, riringanijwe nk’iryo gupimisha uburebure, nca mbwirwa ngo: “Genda upime urusengero rw’Imana n’igicaniro, wongere uharure n’abaza kuhasengera. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Ariko ibaraza ry’inyuma y’urusengero nturipime kuko ni iry’abanyamahanga. Bazomara amezi mirongo ine n’abiri bahonyanga igisagara cera. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Nanje nzoha ububasha ivyabona vyanje bibiri, na bo bazomara imisi igihumbi n’amajana abiri na mirongo itandatu, bavugishwa bambaye amagunira.” <verse eid="REV 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 4:3">Zakariya 4:3</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 4:11">11</ref>,<ref loc="ZEC 4:14">14</ref></char></char></note>Ivyo vyabona bibiri ni vyo biti bibiri vya elayo na vya biterekwako amatara bibiri bihagaze imbere y’Umwami Imana nyene isi yose. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Nihagira uwugerageza kubakorera ikibi, umuriro uzova mu kanwa kabo uturire abansi babo. Uko ni ko uwuzogerageza kubakorera ikibi azopfa. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Bafise ububasha bwo kwugara ikirere kugira ngo imvura ntigwe, igihe cose bazoba bariko baravugishwa; kandi bafise ububasha bwo guhindura amazi amaraso no guteza isi ivyago igihe cose uko babigomvye.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Baheje gushinga intahe, ca gikoko c’i kuzimu kizobatera, kibaneshe, hanyuma kibice. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />Imivyimba yabo izorambikwa kw’ibarabara rya ca gisagara gikuru, kimwe mu mpwemu kigereranywa na Sodomu canke na Egiputa, ico Umwami wabo yabambwemwo. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Kumara imisi itatu n’igice, abantu bo mu mahanga yose, mu moko yose no mu ndimi zose bazokwihweza imivyimba yabo kandi nta n’umwe bazokwemerera kubahamba. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Abazoba baba kw’isi bose bazonezerezwa n’urupfu rwabo, bagire imisi mikuru. Bazohana utuganuke bigina urupfu rw’abo bavugishwa bahora batera ivyago ababa kw’isi.<verse eid="REV 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Ariko inyuma y’imisi itatu n’igice, impwemu y’ubuzima iva ku Mana ibinjiramwo, baca barahaguruka kandi ababibonye bose bafatwa n’ubwoba bwinshi. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Hanyuma humvikana ijwi rirenga rivuye mw’ijuru, rivuga riti: “Nimuduge muze hano!” Nuko baduga mu gicu baja mw’ijuru abansi babo babaraba.<verse eid="REV 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Ako kanya nyene haca humvikana nyamugigima iteye ubwoba isenyura kimwe ca cumi c’ico gisagara, abantu ibihumbi indwi barapfa. Abarokotse bagira ubwoba bwinshi, bahimbaza Imana yo mw’ijuru.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Ico cari icago ca kabiri kirangiye, ariko ica gatatu cagira gishike.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Inzamba igira indwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Umumarayika w’indwi avugije inzamba yiwe, haca humvikana ijwi rivuye mw’ijuru rivuga riti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:15">“Ubwami bwo kw’isi buhindutse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:15">ubw’Umwami Imana na Kristo wiwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:15">kandi azoganza ibihe bidashira.”<verse eid="REV 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Ba bakuru mirongo ibiri na bane bicaye ku ntebe zabo imbere y’Imana baca bikubita hasi bubamye, bahimbaza Imana, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />bavuga bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">“Turaguhaye icubahiro, Mwami Imana Mushoboravyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">wewe uriho kandi wamyeho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">kuko wakiriye ububasha bwawe bukomeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">ugashiraho inganji yawe.<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Amahanga yari yuzuye ishavu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">ariko uburake bwawe buraje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Igihe kirageze co gucira urubanza abapfuye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">no guha impera abakozi bawe ari bo bavugishwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">n’abubaha izina ryawe bose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">abahambaye n’aboroshe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">no kurandura abarandura isi.”<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Maze urusengero rw’Imana mw’ijuru ruca ruruguruka, kandi muri rwo habonekamwo Isandugu y’Isezerano. Nuko haca haba imiravyo, humvikana urwamo n’imituragaro, haba nyamugigima n’imvura y’urubura ikomeye.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s1">Umugore n’igisato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Maze haboneka ikimenyetso gihambaye mw’ijuru, c’umugore yambaye izuba, ukwezi kuri musi y’ibirenge vyiwe, afise n’urugori rw’inyenyeri cumi na zibiri ku mutwe. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />Uwo mugore yari yibungenze kandi yari mu mubabaro nk’uwugira yibaruke. <verse eid="REV 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Haca haboneka n’ikindi kimenyetso mw’ijuru, c’igisato kinini gitukura gifise imitwe indwi n’amahembe cumi, n’urugori ku mutwe umwumwe wose. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Umurizo waco uhungurura ica gatatu c’inyenyeri zo kw’ijuru zikorokera kw’isi. Maze ca gisato gica gihagarara imbere ya wa mugore yagira yibaruke kugira ngo gice kimira uwo mwana akivuka. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2:9">Zaburi 2:9</ref></char></char></note>Uwo mugore aca avyara umwana w’umuhungu, kandi uwo azogazanya umukazo amahanga yose. Uwo mwana aca arasahurwa ajanwa mw’ijuru ku Mana, hafi y’intebe y’inganji yayo. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Wa mugore aca ahungira mu bugararwa aho Imana yamuteguriye ngo amare imisi igihumbi n’amajana abiri na mirongo itandatu agaburirirwaho.<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Maze haduka intambara mw’ijuru. Mikayeli n’abamarayika biwe bagwanya ca gisato. Ca gisato na co n’abamarayika baco barabagwanya. <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />Ariko ca gisato kiraneshwa, maze abamarayika baco na co birukanwa mw’ijuru. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Ca gisato, ari co kiyoka ca kera citwa Umubi canke Satani, uwuzimiza isi yose, gikororerwa kw’isi n’abamarayika baco bose.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Nca numva ijwi rirenga rivuye mw’ijuru, rivuga riti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">“Noneho agakiza, ububasha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">n’Ubwami vy’Imana yacu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">n’ubushobozi bwa Kristo wayo vyashitse.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:10">Kuko umurezi wa bene Data,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">uwabarega imbere y’Imana yacu ijoro n’umurango</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:10">yakororewe hasi.<verse eid="REV 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Bamuneshesheje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">amaraso y’Umwagazi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">hamwe n’ijambo ryo gushinga intahe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:11">Bemeye guheba ubuzima bwabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:11">ntibatinya urupfu.<verse eid="REV 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />None rero nimunezerwe mwa majuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">hamwe namwe ibiyabamwo mwese.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">Ariko haragowe isi n’ibiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">kuko wa mubi yabikororewemwo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 12:12">Yuzuye uburake bwinshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 12:12">kuko azi ko asigaje igihe gito.”<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Ca gisato kimaze kubona ko cakororewe kw’isi, gica gikurikirana wa mugore yavyara wa mwana w’umuhungu. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Wa mugore aca ahabwa amababa nk’ay’inkona nini kugira ngo agurukire mu kibanza yateguriwe mu bugararwa ngo ahamare imyaka itatu n’igice agaburirirwayo, kure ya ca kiyoka. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Ca kiyoka kigerageza gusuka uruzi runini ruva mu kanwa kaco kugira ngo wa mugore atwarwe. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Ariko isi ica ifasha wa mugore, irasama imira rwa ruzi rwava mu kanwa ka ca gisato. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Maze ca gisato gica cuzura ubushangashirwe ku bw’uwo mugore, gica kija gutera intambara abasigaye bo mu ruvyaro rwiwe. Abo ni abitondeye amabwirizwa y’Imana bakama bashingira intahe Yesu.<verse eid="REV 12:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s1">Igikoko cavuye mu kiyaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Ca gisato gica gihagarara ku musenyi wo ku nkengera y’ikiyaga. Hanyuma nca mbona igikoko gisokorotse kiva mu kiyaga. Cari gifise amahembe cumi n’imitwe indwi; ihembe ryose ryariko urugori, kandi ku mutwe wose hari handitseko izina ricokora Imana. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Ico gikoko casa n’ingwe, ariko kikagira ibinono nk’ivy’idubu n’umunwa nk’uw’intambwe. Ca gisato gica giha ububasha bwaco ico gikoko, kigiha n’intebe y’inganji n’ubutware buhambaye. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Ku mutwe umwe w’ico gikoko hari igikomere giteye ubwoba, cashobora kucica, ariko ico gikomere gica kirakira. Maze isi yose itangarira cane ico gikoko, iranagikurikira. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Abantu bose basenga ca gisato kuko cahaye ububasha ico gikoko, basenga na ca gikoko bavuga bati: “Ni nde ahwanye n’ico gikoko? Ni nde yokigwanya akakinesha?”<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Ca gikoko gica cemererwa kuvuga amajambo y’ubwibone yo gucokora Imana, congera gihabwa n’uburenganzira bwo kumara amezi mirongo ine n’abiri gikora ivyo kigomba vyose. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Nuko gica gitangura kuvuga amajambo mabi yo gucokora Imana, no gutuka izina ryayo, n’aho iba, n’ababa mw’ijuru. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Gica gihabwa ububasha bwo kugwanya abera b’Imana no kubanesha. Congera gihabwa n’ububasha bwo kuganza imiryango yose, amoko yose, indimi zose n’amahanga yose. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Kandi ababa kw’isi bose basenga ico gikoko. Abo ni abatanditswe mu gitabu c’ubugingo c’Umwagazi w’Intama yishwe, kuva isi itararemwa.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />Uwufise amatwi yo kwumva niyumve.<verse eid="REV 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />“Uwagenewe kujanwa nk’inyagano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">azojanwa nk’inyagano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 13:10">Uwagenewe kwicishwa inkota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 13:10">azokwicwa n’inkota.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 15:2">Yeremiya 15:2</ref></char></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 13:10">Ibi bisigura ko abera b’Imana bategerezwa kwihangana cane bakagumana ukwizera.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Igikoko gisokoroka kiva mw’isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Hanyuma nca mbona ikindi gikoko gisokorotse kiva mw’isi. Cari gifise amahembe abiri ameze nk’ay’intama, ariko cavuga nk’igisato. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Cari gifise ububasha bwa ca gikoko ca mbere, maze kiganza mu gishingo caco. Gica gitegeka isi yose n’abantu bose bayibako gusenga ca gikoko ca mbere, kimwe cakira igikomere giteye ubwoba. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Gica gikora ibimenyetso n’ibitangaza bihambaye, mbere kimanura n’umuriro uva kw’ijuru ugakorokera kw’isi abantu bose barorera. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Kubera ubwo bubasha cahawe bwo gukora ibimenyetso n’ibitangaza ku bwa ca gikoko ca mbere, kizimiza ababa kw’isi. Gitegeka ababa kw’isi gukora igishushanyo ca ca gikoko ca mbere cari carakomerekejwe cane n’inkota, ariko kigakira. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Gica gihabwa ububasha bwo guha ubuzima ca gishushanyo ca ca gikoko ca mbere, kugira ngo gishobore kuvuga no kwica abo bose bazoba banse kugisenga. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Congera gitegeka ko abantu bose, abakuru n’abato, abatunzi n’abakene, abagurano n’abidegemvya, bashirwako ikimenyetso mu kiganza canke mu ruhanga, <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />kugira ngo ntihagire n’umwe ashobora gusuma canke kudandaza atagifise. Ico kimenyetso ni izina rya ca gikoko canke igiharuro gihagarariye izina ryaco.<verse eid="REV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Gutahura ibi bisaba ubwenge. Uwufise ubwenge arashobora gutahura ivy’ico giharuro c’ico gikoko, kuko ni igiharuro gihagarariye izina ry’umuntu. Ico giharuro ni 666.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s1">Umwagazi w’intama n’abacunguwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Hanyuma nca mbona Umwagazi w’intama ahagaze ku musozi Siyoni, ari kumwe n’abantu ibihumbi ijana na mirongo ine na bine bari banditseko izina ryiwe n’irya Se mu ruhanga. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Nca numva ijwi rivuye mw’ijuru risamirana nk’amazi y’isumo rinini, kandi rivuga nk’umuturagaro uteye ubwoba. Iryo jwi numvise ryari rimeze nk’iry’abacuraranzi bacuraranga inanga. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Baririmbira indirimbo nshasha imbere y’intebe y’inganji, n’imbere ya vya binyabugingo bine hamwe na ba bakuru. Nta n’umwe yashobora kwiga iyo ndirimbo, kiretse bamwe ibihumbi ijana na mirongo ine na bine bacunguwe bakuwe mw’isi. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Abo ni bo batandujwe n’abagore, ariko bazigamye ukwera kwabo, bakurikira wa Mwagazi aho aja hose. Bacunguwe bakuwe mu bantu, kugira ngo bashikanirwe Imana na wa Mwagazi nk’ivyeze ubwa mbere. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Nta bubeshi bwava mu kanwa kabo kandi ntibagira umugayo.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubutumwa bw’abamarayika batatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Hanyuma nca mbona uwundi mumarayika aguruka mu kirere, atwaye Ubutumwa Bwiza agiye kubwira abari mw’isi mu moko yose, mu miryango yose, mu ndimi zose no mu mahanga yose. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />Avuga n’ijwi rirenga ati: “Mutinye Imana kandi muyihe icubahiro, kuko igihe cayo co guca imanza kirashitse. Musenge iyaremye ijuru n’isi, ibiyaga n’amasoko y’amazi.”<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Hanyuma uwundi mumarayika agira kabiri aca akurikira uwo wa mbere avuga ati: “Kirasenyutse! Kirasenyutse Babiloni, igisagara gihambaye, canywesheje amahanga yose ku muvinyu w’ubusambanyi bwaco bukomeye.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 21:9">Yesaya 21:9</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Mu nyuma haza umumarayika agira gatatu, na we akurikira avuga n’ijwi rirenga ati: “Nihagira uwusenga ca gikoko n’igishushanyo caco, canke akemera gushirwako ca kimenyetso caco mu ruhanga canke mu kiganza, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />na we nyene azonywa ku muvinyu w’uburake bw’Imana, wasutswe mu gikombe c’ubushangashirwe bw’Imana utavanze. Azobabarizwa mu muriro n’ibizuku vyaka imbere y’abamarayika n’imbere ya wa Mwagazi. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Umwotsi w’ukubabazwa kwabo uzokwama upfunduka ibihe vyose. Abazosenga ico gikoko n’igishushanyo caco, canke abazokwemera gushirwako ikimenyetso c’izina ryaco, nta gahengwe bazogira haba mw’ijoro canke ku murango.” <verse eid="REV 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Ni co gituma abera b’Imana, bubaha amabwirizwa yayo bakaguma mu kwizera Yesu, bakwiye kwihangana cane.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Hanyuma nca numva ijwi rivuye mw’ijuru rimbwira riti: “Andika ibi bikurikira: uhereye ubu, hahiriwe abapfa bapfira mu Mwami.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 14:13">Mpwemu aravuga ati: “Egome, bazoruhuka imiruho barushe, kuko ibikorwa vyabo bizobaherekeza.”<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyimburwa vyo kw’isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">14:14 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">
        <char style="xt">
          <ref loc="DAN 7:13">Daniyeli 7:13</ref>
        </char>
      </char>
    </note>Hanyuma nca mbona igicu cera, kandi kuri co hari hicaye uwusa n’Umwana w’Umuntu. Yari yambaye urugori rw’inzahabu ku mutwe, afise n’umuhoro ukarishe mu minwe. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Haca haza uwundi mumarayika avuye mu rusengero, arasemerera abwira umwe yicaye ku gicu ati: “Bangura umuhoro wawe wimbure, kuko igihe co kwimbura kirageze, ivyimburwa vyo kw’isi bireze.” <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Nuko umwe yicaye ku gicu aca acisha umuhoro wiwe kw’isi, maze isi yose irimburwa.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Uwundi mumarayika asohoka avuye mu rusengero mw’ijuru, kandi na we nyene yari afise umuhoro ukarishe. <verse eid="REV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Uwundi mumarayika, yari afise ububasha ku muriro, aza avuye ku gicaniro, ahamagara umwe afise umuhoro ukarishe n’ijwi rirenga avuga ati: “Fata umuhoro wawe ukarishe, usorome inzabibu zo mu ruzabibu rwo kw’isi, kuko inzabibu zireze.” <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Wa mumarayika aca abangurira umuhoro kw’isi, asoroma inzabibu, azisuka mu bwato bw’uburake bw’Imana. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Izo nzabibu ziganirwa mu bwato buri inyuma y’igisagara, amaraso yazo araduga gushika ku minwa y’amafarasi, yongera arasanzara gushika nko kuri sitadiyo igihumbi n’amajana atandatu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilometero 300.</char></note><verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s1">Abamarayika indwi n’ivyago indwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Hanyuma mbona mw’ijuru ikindi kimenyetso gihambaye kandi gitangaje. Hari abamarayika indwi bafise ivyago indwi vya nyuma, bizorangiza uburake bwose bw’Imana. <verse eid="REV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Nca mbona n’ikimeze nk’ikiyaga c’ibiyo bivanze n’umuriro. I ruhande yaco hari hahagaze abanesheje ca gikoko n’igishushanyo caco n’ikimenyetso c’izina ryaco. Bari bafise inanga bahawe n’Imana, <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />baririmba indirimbo ya Mose umukozi w’Imana n’iy’Umwagazi w’intama, bavuga bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">“Ibikorwa vyawe birahambaye kandi biratangaje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">Mwami, Imana Mushoboravyose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Inzira zawe ziragororotse kandi ni iz’ukuri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">Mwami w’amahanga.<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Ni nde atazogutinya ga Mwami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">ngo aheshe icubahiro izina ryawe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Ni wewe wenyene wera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Amahanga yose azoza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">apfukame imbere yawe agusenge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">kuko ibikorwa vyawe vy’ukugororoka vyaramenyekanye.”<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Hanyuma y’ivyo nca mbona mw’ijuru urusengero rurimwo ihema ry’isezerano rwuguruye. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Ba bamarayika indwi bafise ivyago indwi baca barasohoka bava mu rusengero. Bari bambaye impuzu zera derere zitanduye, bakenyeje imikanda y’inzahabu. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Kimwe mu binyabugingo gica giha ba bamarayika indwi inzavya indwi zuzuyemwo uburake bw’Imana ihoraho. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Ubwo nyene urusengero ruca rwuzura umwotsi uvuye mu cubahiro c’Imana n’ububasha bwayo, ntihaba hakigira uwushobora kwinjira muri urwo rusengero gushika ba bamarayika indwi bashikije vya vyago indwi.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s1">Inzavya indwi z’uburake bw’Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Nca numva ijwi rirenga rivuye mu rusengero ribwira ba bamarayika indwi riti: “Nimugende, musuke uburake bw’Imana buri mu nzavya indwi kw’isi.”<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Umumarayika wa mbere aragenda asuka ivyari mu rwavya rwiwe kw’isi. Haca haduka ibisebe bibi kandi bibabaza ku bantu bari bafise ikimenyetso ca ca gikoko bagasenga n’igishushanyo caco.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Uwa kabiri asuka ivyari mu rwavya rwiwe ku kiyaga, gica gihinduka nk’amaraso y’umuntu yapfuye. Ivyaba mu kiyaga vyose bica birapfa.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Uwa gatatu na we asuka ivyari mu rwavya rwiwe mu masoko y’inzuzi n’ay’imigezi, aca ahinduka amaraso. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Nca numva umumarayika yari afise ububasha ku mazi avuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:5">“Wewe Wera, uwuriho kandi wamyeho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:5">uragororotse mu guca imanza nk’izi.<verse eid="REV 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Basheshe amaraso y’abera bawe n’abavugishwa bawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:6">none ubahaye amaraso ngo banywe. Ni yo mpera bakwiye.”<verse eid="REV 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Nca numva igicaniro cishura giti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 16:7">“Egome, Mwami Imana Mushoboravyose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 16:7">imanza zawe ni iz’ukuri kandi ziragororotse.”<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Umumarayika wa kane na we asuka ivyari mu rwavya rwiwe ku zuba, rica rihabwa ububasha bwo guturiza abantu umuriro waryo. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Abantu bose baturirwa n’ubushuhe buteye ubwoba; baca batuka izina ry’Imana yo ifise ububasha kuri ivyo vyago. Ariko ntibihana ivyaha vyabo ngo bagaruke ku Mana bayihe icubahiro.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Umumarayika wa gatanu na we asuka ivyari mu rwavya rwiwe ku ntebe y’inganji ya ca gikoko, ubwami bwaco buca bwuzura umwijima. Ababubamwo bihekenya indimi kubera imibabaro barimwo, <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />batuka Imana yo mw’ijuru kubera imibabaro yabo n’ibisebe vyabo, ariko ntibihana ivyaha bakoze ngo bagaruke ku Mana.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Umumarayika wa gatandatu na we asuka ivyari mu rwavya rwiwe mu ruzi runini Efurata, amazi yarwo aca arakama, kugira ngo abami bo mu buseruko baronke aho bacisha ingabo zabo. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Nca mbona impwemu mbi zitatu zimeze nk’ibikere, ziva mu kanwa ka ca gisato, n’aka ca gikoko, n’aka wa muvugishwa w’ibinyoma. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Izo ni impwemu z’abadayimoni zikora ibitangaza n’ibimenyetso, zikaja ku bami bo kw’isi yose, kugira ngo zibakoranirize ku rugamba ku musi uhambaye w’Imana Mushoboravyose.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="mi">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />
    <char style="wj">“Ehe ndaje nk’igisuma ata wunyiteze. Hahiriwe uwama ari maso, akama yambaye, kugira ngo ntazogende ari gusa, akamaramazwa n’ubwambure bwiwe.”</char><verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Maze zica zikoraniriza ba bami mu kibanza citwa Haramagedoni mu rurimi rw’Igiheburayo.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Umumarayika w’indwi aca asuka ivyari mu rwavya rwiwe mu kirere, maze mu rusengero humvikana ijwi riva ku ntebe y’inganji, rivuga riti: “Birarangiye!” <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Ubwo nyene haca haboneka imiravyo, humvikana urwamo rwinshi, imituragaro na nyamugigima ikomeye itari yigere kubaho kuva abantu babaho kw’isi. Iyo nyamugigima yari iteye ubwoba cane. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Ca gisagara gikuru gica cigaburamwo gutatu, ibisagara vy’amahanga birasenyagurika. Maze Imana yibuka ivyaha vya Babiloni igisagara gihambaye, ica ikinywesha ku gikombe cuzuye umuvinyu w’uburake bwayo buteye ubwoba. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Amazinga yose aranyika, n’imitumba yose ntiyaba ikiboneka. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Haca haza urubura rwinshi ruvuye kw’ijuru rugwa ku bantu kandi rumwe rwapima nk’italanto imwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 45.</char></note>. Abantu baca batuka Imana kubera ico cago c’urubura, kuko cari icago giteye ubwoba.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s1">Maraya na ca gikoko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Umwe muri ba bamarayika indwi bari basutse ivyago indwi, aranyegera ambwira ati: “Ingo ndakwereke igihano kizohabwa wa mumaraya ahambaye, aganje ibiyaga vyinshi. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Abami b’isi bose basambanye na we, kandi ababa kw’isi bose baborejwe n’umuvinyu w’ubusambanyi bwiwe.”<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Wa mumarayika aca antwara mu bugaragwa ndi muri Mpwemu. Nca mbona umugore agendera ku gikoko gitukura, gifise imitwe indwi n’amahembe cumi, cuzuyeko n’amajambo yo gutuka Imana. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Uwo mugore yari yambaye impuzu z’agaciro zitukura, kandi yari ashazishije inzahabu n’utubuye tw’igiciro, hamwe n’imaragarita. Mu minwe yari afise igikombe c’inzahabu cuzuye ibiterasoni n’ibihumanya bivuye ku busambanyi bwiwe. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Ibi ni vyo vyari vyanditse mu ruhanga rwiwe:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">
    <char style="sc">Babiloni Hahambaye</char></para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">
    <char style="sc">Nyina w’Abamaraya bose</char></para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 17:5">
    <char style="sc">n’Ibihumanya vyo kw’isi.</char><verse eid="REV 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Kandi narabona ko uwo mugore yari aborewe n’amaraso y’abera, amaraso y’abashingiye intahe Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Ndamubonye ndatangara cane. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Wa mumarayika arambarira ati: “Kubera iki utangaye? Reka ndagusigurire amabanga y’urya mugore n’ico gikoko agenderako gifise imitwe indwi n’amahembe cumi. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Kirya gikoko wabonye, carigeze kubaho ariko ubu ntikikiriho, ariko kizogaruka vuba kivuye i kuzimu, kije kurandurwa. Ababa kw’isi batandikishije amazina yabo mu gitabu c’ubugingo kuva isi ikiremwa bazotangara nibabona ico gikoko, kuko cigeze kubaho, ubu kikaba kitakiriho, hanyuma kikazoba kizogaruka.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />Gutahura ibi bisaba umutima w’ubwenge: Arya mahembe indwi ni imitumba indwi uwo mugore yicayeko, yerekana kandi abami indwi. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Batanu muri bo baratembagajwe, umwe araganje, uwundi ntaraza, ariko niyaza, inganji yiwe izoba iyo umwanya muto cane. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Kirya gikoko cabayeho ariko ubu kikaba kitariho ni umwami agira umunani. Ni umwe muri bamwe indwi kandi na we nyene agiye kuranduka.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />Arya mahembe cumi wabonye, ni abami cumi batarahabwa ubwami, ariko bazohabwa ububasha bamare ikiringo c’isaha imwe baganje hamwe na ca gikoko. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Abo cumi bose bafise intumbero imwe kandi bazoha ca gikoko ububasha n’ubushobozi vyabo. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Bazotera intambara bagwanye Umwagazi w’intama, ariko azobanesha kuko ni Uwuganza abatware kandi ni Umwami w’abami. Abo yahamagaye akabatoranya bakamubera abizigirwa, bazoba bari kumwe na we.”<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Wa mumarayika aca ambwira ati: “Birya biyaga wabonye wa mumaraya yari yicayeko, ni amasinzi y’abantu bo mu mahanga yose no mu ndimi zose. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Kirya gikoko n’amahembe cumi yaco wabonye bizokwanka urya mumaraya. Bizomwambura ivyo afise vyose bimusige ari gusa. Bizomurya inyama hanyuma ibisigazwa vyiwe bibiturire mu muriro. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Kuko Imana yashize mu mitima yavyo gushitsa ivyo ishaka, bizokwemeranya guha ububasha bwavyo ca gikoko, gushitsa amajambo y’Imana ashikijwe. <verse eid="REV 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />Urya mugore wabonye ni igisagara gihambaye kiganza abami bo kw’isi.”<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s1">Ugusenyuka kwa Babiloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Inyuma y’ivyo nca mbona uwundi mumarayika yururuka ava mw’ijuru. Yari afise ubushobozi bwinshi kandi isi yari imurikiwe n’ugukayangana kwiwe. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Arasemerera n’ijwi rirenga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">“ ‘Kirasenyutse! Kirasenyutse Babiloni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">igisagara gihambaye!’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 21:9">Yesaya 21:9</ref></char></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">Ubu gihindutse inzu y’abadayimoni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:2">ubwihisho bw’impwemu zihumanye zose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">ubwihisho bw’inyoni zihumanye zose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:2">n’ubwihisho bw’ibikoko bihumanye kandi bisesema vyose.<verse eid="REV 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Kuko amahanga yose yanyoye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">ku muvinyu w’ubusambanyi bwaco burenze urugero.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:3">Abami b’isi bose basambanye na co,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:3">kandi abadandaza bo kw’isi batungishijwe n’ibikayangana vyaco vyinshi cane.”<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Nca numva irindi jwi rivuye mw’ijuru rivuga riti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">“ ‘Nimusohoke mukivemwo, mwa bwoko bwanje,’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 51:45">Yeremiya 51:45</ref></char></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">kugira ngo ntimwifatanye na co mu vyaha vyaco,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">maze mugashikirwa n’ivyago bizogishikira.<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Kuko ivyaha vyaco vyarundanye bishika mw’ijuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">none Imana yibutse ibikorwa bibi vyaco.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Nimucishure ivyo cakoreye abandi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">mugikorere incuro zibiri ivyo cakoze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:6">Nimwuzuze igikombe canywesherejeko abandi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">inzoga iboreza incuro zibiri kurusha.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Cishize hejuru, cibera mu bikayangana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">none nimucishure imibabaro n’ivyago.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Cirata mu mutima kiti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">‘Nganje nk’umwamikazi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">sindi umupfakazi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">kandi sinzokwigera ngandara.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 47:7">Yesaya 47:7</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 47:8">8</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />None rero ku musi umwe, kizohwikirwa n’ivyago:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">urupfu, ikigandaro n’ikigoyi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">Kizotongorwa n’umuriro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">kuko Umwami Imana agiciriye urubanza ari umunyabushobozi.”<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Abami bo kw’isi basambanye bakongera bagasangira na co ubutunzi bwaco, nibabona umwotsi wo gutongorwa kwaco, bazokiririra bongere bakigandarire. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Bazobirabira kure kubera gutinya imibabaro igishikiye, maze bakome induru bavuga bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">“Ibara! Ibara riraguye kuri ca gisagara gihambaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:10">Babiloni ca gisagara gikomeye!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:10">Mu kanya isase, urubanza waciriwe ruragushitseko!”<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Abadandaza bo kw’isi bazokiririra bakigandarire, kuko ata wuzoba akibagurira ibidandazwa vyabo. <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />Cahora kibagurira ibidandazwa bigizwe n’inzahabu, ifeza, amabuye y’agaciro n’utubuyenge; impuzu zera nziza, izitukura n’izisa n’agahama nziza; ivyakozwe mu biti bimota neza, ivyakozwe mu mahembe y’inzovu, ivyabajwe mu biti vyiza vy’igiciro kinini, ivyacuzwe mu butare bw’umwakaka no mu vyuma hamwe n’amabuye abajwe. <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />Cabagurira kandi ivyitwa kinamoni n’ibindi birungo, ibimota neza, amavuta yitwa mira, imibavu, imivinyu, amavuta ya elayo, ifu inoze neza n’ingano, inka n’intama, amafarasi n’imikogote hamwe n’abantu bagurishwa nk’abagurano.<verse eid="REV 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Bazovuga bati: “Ivyo wahahamira cane uravyatswe. Ubutunzi bwawe n’ugukayangana kwawe vyose biguhezeko, ntibizosubira kuboneka.” <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Abadandaza bari baratungishijwe no gushora ivyo bidandazwa muri co, bazobirabira kure kubera gutinya imibabaro igishikiye. Bazorira, bagandare, <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />bavuga bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:16">“Ibara! Ibara riraguye kuri ca gisagara gihambaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">cambaye impuzu z’igiciro kinini, izitukura n’iz’agahama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:16">gishazishije inzahabu n’amabuye y’agaciro n’utubuyenge.<verse eid="REV 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Mu kanya isase, ubwo butunzi bwose buhindutse ubusa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Abagendesha ubwato, ababugenderamwo, abasoza hamwe n’abakorera ibikorwa vyabo mu kiyaga, bazobirabira kure. <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />Nibabona umwotsi w’ugutongorwa kwaco, bazovuga bati: “Mbega hari igisagara cari gihambaye nk’iki?” <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Bazokwisuka umukungugu ku mitwe, barire, bagandare, bavuga bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">“Ibara! Ibara riraguye kuri ca gisagara gihambaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">kimwe catungisha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:19">abafise amato ku kiyaga!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:19">Mu kanya isase, gihindutse ubugaragwa!<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Nimubinezerererwe, yemwe mwa majuru!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">Nimunezerwe, yemwe bwoko bw’Imana!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">Nimunezerwe, yemwe ntumwa n’abavugishwa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:20">Imana yagiciriye urubanza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:20">ruhwanye n’ivyo cabakoreye.”<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Hanyuma umumarayika w’inkomezi aca atora ibuye rimeze nk’urusyo runini, ariterera mu kiyaga, avuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:21">“Uku ni ko Babiloni, igisagara gihambaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">kizokubitwa hasi biteye ubwoba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:21">kandi ntikizosubira kuboneka.<verse eid="REV 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Nta bavuza inanga, abaririmvyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">abavuza imyironge canke inzumbete</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">bazosubira kwumvikana muri wewe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">Nta bakora utugenegene tw’ubwoko na bumwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">bazoba bakiboneka muri wewe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:22">Nta jwi ry’urusyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:22">rizosubira kwumvikana muri wewe.<verse eid="REV 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Nta muco w’amatara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">uzosubira gukayangana muri wewe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">Nta majwi y’umukwe n’umugeni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">azosubira kwumvikana muri wewe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:23">Abadandaza bawe bari rurangiranwa kw’isi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:23">Amahanga yose yazimijwe n’amareba yawe.<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Muri co habonetse amaraso y’abavugishwa n’ay’abera b’Imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:24">hamwe n’ay’abandi bose biciwe kw’isi.”<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="s1">Indirimbo z’intsinzi mw’ijuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Inyuma y’ivyo nca numva amajwi asamirana mw’ijuru ameze nk’ay’abantu amasinzi n’amasinzi, asemerera ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">“Haleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:1">Agakiza, icubahiro n’ubushobozi, ni ivy’Imana yacu,<verse eid="REV 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />kuko imanza zayo ni iz’ukuri kandi ziragororotse.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">Yaciriye urubanza wa mumaraya akomeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:2">umwe yononesha isi ubusambanyi bwiwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:2">Yaramwihoye kubera amaraso y’abakozi bayo yasheshe.”<verse eid="REV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Bongera barasemerera bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">“Haleluya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:3">Umwotsi uva muri ca gisagara wama uduga ibihe vyose.”<verse eid="REV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Ba batama mirongo ibiri na bane na vya binyabugingo bine baca bikubita hasi bubamye, batazira Imana yicaye ku ntebe y’inganji, bavuga bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:4">“Amen! Haleluya!”<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Haca humvikana ijwi rivuye kuri ya ntebe y’inganji, rivuga riti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">“Nimushime Imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">yemwe bakozi bayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:5">namwe abayubaha mwese,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:5">abahambaye n’aboroshe.”<verse eid="REV 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Nca numva amajwi avuga nk’ay’abantu amasinzi n’amasinzi, avuga nk’imipfunda yo mu kiyaga ikomeye, agaturagara nk’inkuba, avuga ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:6">“Haleluya!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:6">Umwami wacu Imana Mushoboravyose iraganje.<verse eid="REV 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Tunezerwe, duhimbarwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">tuyihe icubahiro!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 19:7">Kuko ubukwe bw’Umwagazi w’intama burashitse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:7">kandi umugeni wiwe aramaze kwitegura.<verse eid="REV 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Impuzu zera, zimesuye kandi zikayangana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 19:8">ni zo yahawe ngo yambare.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 19:8">Impuzu zera zisigura ibikorwa vyiza vy’ukugororoka vy’abera b’Imana.<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Wa mumarayika aca ambarira ati: “Andika uti: Hahiriwe abatumiwe ku mazimano y’ubukwe bw’Umwagazi w’intama!” Yongerako ati: “Aya ni amajambo y’ukuri y’Imana.”<verse eid="REV 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Numvise ivyo nca nikubita hasi nubamye ngo ndamusenge. Ariko aca ambwira ati: “Ntugakore ivyo! Nanje ndi umukozi w’Imana co kimwe na we na bene So bashingira intahe ukwizera bafise muri Kristo. Usenge Imana yonyene. Kuko ugushingira intahe Yesu ni impwemu y’ubuvugishwa.”<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivy’ifarasi yera n’uwayigenderako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Maze nca mbona ijuru rirugurutse n’ifarasi yera ihagaze imbere yanje. Uwayigenderako yitwa Mwizigirwa na Munyakuri, kuko aca imanza zibereye kandi akagwana intambara mu buryo bugororotse. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Amaso yiwe yasa n’imbeya z’umuriro kandi yari afise ingori nyinshi ku mutwe. Yari afise izina rimwanditseko kandi nta n’umwe ashobora kuritahura atari we nyene. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Yari yambaye ikanzu yinitswe mu maraso, kandi izina ryiwe ni Jambo w’Imana. <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Ingabo zo mw’ijuru zariko ziramukurikira ziri ku mafarasi yera, zambaye impuzu zera zikayangana. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Mu kanwa kiwe havamwo inkota ikarishe; kandi iyo ni yo yakubitisha amahanga. “Azoganzisha amahanga umukazo.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 2:9">Zaburi 2:9</ref></char></char></note> Azorekura ubushangashirwe bw’Imana Mushoboravyose nk’uwuganira inzabibu mu bwato. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Kw’ikanzu yiwe no kw’itako rwiwe hari handitseko ngo:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="REV 19:16">
    <char style="sc">Umwami w’abami, Uwuganza abatware.</char><verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Nongera mbona umumarayika yari ahagaze mu zuba, asemerera n’ijwi rirenga abwira ibisiga biguruka mu kirere ati: “Nimuze, mukoranire ku mazimano ahambaye y’Imana, <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />kugira ngo murye inyama z’abami, abagabisha b’ingabo, abahambaye, amafarasi n’abayagenderako, n’inyama z’abantu bose, abagurano n’abidegemvya, abakuru n’abato.”<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Nca mbona ca gikoko, mbona n’abami bo mw’isi bose n’ingabo zabo bakoraniye kugwanya umwe agendera kw’ifarasi n’ingabo ziwe. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Ariko ca gikoko gica gifatwa mpiri hamwe na wa muvugishwa w’ibinyoma yakora ibitangaza mw’izina ryaco. Ivyo bitangaza ni vyo cahendesha bamwe bashirwako ikimenyetso caco, bagasenga n’igishushanyo caco. Ca gikoko na wa muvugishwa w’ibinyoma baca batererwa mu kiyaga caka umuriro. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Za ngabo zose zica zicishwa ya nkota ikarishe yava mu kanwa k’uwugendera kuri ya farasi yera, maze ibisiga vyo mu kirere vyose bica birya inyama zabo.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s1">Imyaka igihumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Hanyuma mbona umumarayika yururuka ava mw’ijuru, afise impfunguruzo z’i kuzimu, afise umunyororo munini mu minwe. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Aca afata ca gisato, ari co kiyoka ca kera, ari we wa mubi canke Satani, arakiboha, kimara imyaka igihumbi kiboshe. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Aca agikororera i kuzimu, acugaranirayo, kugira ngo ntikibandanye kizimiza amahanga gushika iyo myaka igihumbi iheze. Ariko inyuma y’iyo myaka kizorekurwa akanya gatoya.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Nca mbona intebe z’inganji zicaweko n’abahawe ubushobozi bwo guca imanza. Hanyuma nca mbona imishaha y’abaciwe imitwe bahorwa gushingira intahe Yesu no kuvuga ijambo ry’Imana. Abo ntibigeze basenga ca gikoko canke ngo basenge igishushanyo caco, kandi ntibashizweko ikimenyetso caco ku ruhanga canke mu kiganza. Nuko basubira kuba bazima, baganzanya na Kristo imyaka igihumbi. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />(Abapfuye bandi ntibasubiye kuzuka iyo myaka igihumbi idaheze.) Iri ni ryo zuka rya mbere. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Barahiriwe kandi ni abera abazoba muri iryo zuka rya mbere. Urupfu rwa kabiri nta bubasha ruzobagirako, ariko bazoba abaherezi b’Imana na Kristo, kandi bazoganzanya na we imyaka igihumbi.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Satani acirwa urubanza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Iyo myaka igihumbi iheze, Satani azorekurwa ave mw’ibohero ryiwe, <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />hanyuma asohoke aje kuzimiza amahanga yitwa Gogi na Magogi, mu mpande zine z’isi. Azobakoranya ngo batere intambara, kandi bazoba ari benshi bangana n’umusenyi wo ku kiyaga. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Nuko ndababona bagendagenda isi yose, bakikuza ikibanza abera b’Imana barimwo n’igisagara Imana ikunda. Ariko umuriro uramanuka uvuye mw’ijuru, urabarigita. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Wa mubi yabahenda, atabwa mu kiyaga caka umuriro, aho ca gikoko na wa muvugishwa w’ibinyoma bari batawe. Bazobabazwa ijoro n’umurango, ibihe bidashira.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abapfuye bacirwa urubanza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Hanyuma nca mbona intebe y’inganji nini cane, mbona n’uwuyicayeko. Ijuru n’isi birahunga biva imbere yiwe, ntivyasubira kuboneka. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Nca mbona abapfuye, abakuru n’abato, bahagaze imbere ya ya ntebe, maze ibitabu birazingururwa. Ikindi gitabu kirugururwa, ni co gitabu c’ubugingo. Abapfuye bacirwa imanza z’ivyo bakoze nk’uko vyari vyanditse muri ico gitabu. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Ikiyaga kigarukana abapfuye bari muri co, urupfu na kuzimu bigarukana abari muri vyo, umwe wese acirwa urubanza ruhwanye n’ivyo yakoze. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Maze rupfu na kuzimu bitererwa mu kiyaga caka umuriro. Ico kiyaga caka umuriro ni co rupfu rwa kabiri. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Umuntu wese atasanze izina ryiwe ryanditswe mu gitabu c’ubugingo, atererwa muri ico kiyaga caka umuriro.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ijuru rishasha n’isi nshasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Hanyuma nca mbona ijuru rishasha n’isi nshasha,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 65:17">Yesaya 65:17</ref></char></char></note> kuko ijuru rya mbere n’isi ya mbere vyari vyakuweho, kandi nta n’ikiyaga cari kikihari. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Nca mbona n’Igisagara Cera, Yerusalemu nshasha, yururuka ivuye mw’ijuru ku Mana, uteguwe nk’umugeni yambitswe neza, ateguriwe umugabo wiwe. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Nca numva ijwi rirenga rivuye kuri ya ntebe y’inganji, rivuga riti: “Ehe raba inzu y’Imana iri mu bantu, kandi izobana na bo. Bazoba abantu bayo, kandi Imana ubwayo izobana na bo, ibe Imana yabo. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Izobahanagura amosozi yose ku maso yabo. Nta rupfu canke kugandara, nta kurira canke kubabara bizoba bikiriho, kuko ivya kera bizoba bikuweho.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">Yesaya 25:8</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Uwari yicaye ku ntebe y’inganji aravuga ati: “Ehe vyose ndabihinduye bishasha!” Aca ambwira ati: “Andika ibi mvuze, kuko aya majambo ni ayo kwizigirwa kandi ni ay’ukuri.”<verse eid="REV 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Yongera ambwira ati: “Birarangiye. Ndi Alufa na Omega, Intango n’Iherezo. Uwunyotewe nzomuha kunywa ku mbizi z’amazi y’ubugingo ku buntu. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Uwuzonesha azotorana ibi vyose kandi nzomubera Imana, na we azombera umwana. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Ariko abahemuka, abatizera, abakora ibiterasoni, abicanyi, abasambanyi, abapfumu, abasenga ibigirwamana n’ababeshi bose, ikibanza cabo ni ikiyaga caka umuriro, ari rwo rupfu rwa kabiri.”<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalemu nshasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Umwe muri ba bamarayika indwi bari bafise inzavya indwi zarimwo ivyago indwi vya nyuma araza ambarira ati: “Ingo ndakwereke umugeni, ari we mugore wa wa Mwagazi w’intama.” <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Aca anjana ndi muri mpwemu, andugana ku musozi munini kandi muremure, aca anyereka igisagara cera, Yerusalemu, cururuka kiva mw’ijuru ku Mana. <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />Ico gisagara cakayangana ubwiza bw’Imana kandi imishwarara yaco yari imeze nk’iy’akabuye k’igiciro kitwa yasipi, kibonerana nk’ikiyo. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Cari kizitijwe uruhome runini mu bwaguke kandi rurerure, rufise amarembo cumi n’abiri arinzwe n’abamarayika cumi na babiri. Kandi amazina y’imiryango cumi n’ibiri ya Isirayeli yari yanditse kuri ayo marembo. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Mu buseruko hari amarembo atatu, mu buraruko atatu, mu bumanuko atatu, no mu burengero atatu nyene. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Uruzitiro rw’ico gisagara rwari rwubakiye ku mabuye cumi n’abiri y’urufatiro, ari zo ntumwa z’Umwagazi w’intama.<verse eid="REV 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Wa mumarayika yamvugisha yari afise ico gupimisha gikozwe mu nkoni y’inzahabu, kugira ngo apime igisagara, amarembo yaco, n’inzitiro zaco. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Igisagara cari kimeze nka kwadarato, uburebure n’ubwaguke vyarangana. Apimye igisagara asanga gipima sitadiyo ibihumbi cumi na bibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilometero 2.200.</char></note> mu burebure, mu bwaguke no mu gihagararo. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Aca apima n’uruzitiro akoresheje ingero abantu basanzwe bakoresha, asanga rupima ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ijana na mirongo ine na zine<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 65.</char></note> z’uburebure bw’igihagararo. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Uruzitiro rwari rwubakishijwe ibuye ry’agaciro ryitwa yasipi, igisagara na co cari cubakishijwe inzahabu, kibonerana nk’ibiyo. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Umushinge w’uruzitiro rw’ico gisagara wari ushazishijwe n’amabuye y’agaciro y’ubwoko bwose. Irya mbere ryari yasipi, irya kabiri safiro, irya gatatu kalukedoni, irya kane simaragido, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />irya gatanu onigisi, irya gatandatu sarudiyo, iry’indwi kilusorito, iry’umunani berulo, iry’icenda topazi, iry’icumi kirusopuraso, iry’icumi na rimwe huwakinto, iry’icumi na kabiri ametusito. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Imiryango y’amarembo uko ari cumi n’ibiri yari ikozwe mw’imaragarita cumi na zibiri, umuryango umwumwe wose wari ukozwe mw’imaragarita imwe. Ibarabara rikuru ryo muri ico gisagara ryari rigizwe n’inzahabu zivugutiwe, rikabonerana nk’ibiyo.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Nta rusengero nabonye muri ico gisagara, kuko Umwami Imana Mushoboravyose n’Umwagazi w’intama ari bo rusengero rwaho. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Muri ico gisagara nta zuba canke ukwezi bikenewe vyo kuhamurikira, kuko ubwiza bw’Imana buhamurikira, kandi Umwagazi w’intama akaba ari we tara ryaho. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Amahanga yose azogendera mu muco waho, kandi abami bo kw’isi bose bazohazana ubutunzi bwabo. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Amarembo y’ico gisagara yama yuguruye, kuko nta joro rihaba. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Ubwiza n’icubahiro vy’amahanga bizozanwa muri co. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Nta kintu gihumanye na kimwe kizokwinjirayo, kandi nta wukora ibiterasoni canke umubeshi azogerayo. Hazojayo abo amazina yabo yanditswe mu gitabu c’ubugingo c’Umwagazi w’intama gusa.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="s1">Edeni hasubira kubaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Maze wa mumarayika aca anyereka rwa ruzi rw’amazi y’ubugingo, rubonerana nk’ikiyo, rutemba ruva ku ntebe y’inganji y’Imana n’iy’Umwagazi w’Intama, <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />rukamanuka ruca hagati muri rya barabara rinini ryo mu gisagara. Ku mpande zompi z’urwo ruzi hari igiti c’ubugingo, cama cumi na kabiri mu mwaka, kikama uko ukwezi gutashe. Kandi amababi yaco ni umuti wo gukiza amahanga. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Nta muvumo uzobayo, kuko intebe y’inganji y’Imana n’iy’Umwagazi w’intama zizoba ziri muri ico gisagara, kandi abakozi bayo bazoyisenga. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Bazobona mu nyonga hayo, kandi izina ryayo rizokwandikwa mu ruhanga rwabo. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Nta joro rizobayo kandi nta muco w’itara canke w’izuba bazokenera, kuko Umwami Imana azobamurikira. Kandi bazoganza ibihe vyose.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohana n’umumarayika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Wa mumarayika arambarira ati: “Aya majambo ni ay’ukwizerwa kandi ni ay’ukuri. Umwami, Imana iganza impwemu z’abavugishwa, yarungitse umumarayika wayo kwereka abasavyi bayo ibigiye kuzoshika.”<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />
    <char style="wj">“Ehe ndaza vuba! Hahirwa abumvira amajambo y’ubuvugishwa yanditse muri uwu muzingo w’igitabu.”</char><verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Jewe Yohana, ni jewe niyumviye aya majambo, nibonera n’ivyo vyose. Maze kuvyiyumvira no kuvyibonera, nca nikubita imbere ya wa mumarayika nubamye ngo ndamusenge. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Ariko arambarira ati: “Reka! Ntukansenge kuko nanje ndi umukozi w’Imana co kimwe na we na bene So b’abavugishwa, ndetse n’abo bose bumvira amajambo ari muri uwu muzingo w’igitabu. Usenge Imana yonyene!”<verse eid="REV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Yongera ambarira ati: “Aya majambo y’ubuvugishwa ntuyanyegeze kuko igihe kiri hafi. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Uwukora ibibi nabandanye akore ibibi, uwiyanduza nabandanye yandure; uwukora ivyiza nabandanye akora ivyiza, uwejejwe nabandanye yezwe.”<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Amajambo yo kurangiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />
    <char style="wj">“Ehe ndaza vuba, nzaniye impera umuntu wese ikwiranye n’ivyo yakoze.</char> <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" /><char style="wj">Ndi Alufa na Omega, uwa Mbere n’uwa Nyuma, Intango n’Iherezo.</char><verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />
    <char style="wj">Hahirwa abamesura amakanzu yabo, kuko bazohabwa uburenganzira bwo kurya ku giti c’ubugingo no kwinjira mw’irembo rya ca gisagara.</char> <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" /><char style="wj">Inyuma y’igisagara hazoba hari imbwa, abapfumu, abasambanyi, abicanyi, abasenga ibigirwamana hamwe n’abakunda kubesha bakanabikora.</char><verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />
    <char style="wj">Ni jewe Yesu narungitse umumarayika wanje ngo aguhe ubu butumwa ubushire amashengero. Nkomoka mu muryango wa Dawidi nkaba na samuragwa w’ingoma yiwe, kandi ni jewe Nyenyeri yakaka yo mu mutwenzi.”</char><verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Mpwemu w’Imana n’umugeni baravuga bati: “Kaze.” N’uwumvise aya majambo wese avuge ati: “Kaze.” Uwunyotewe wese naze, kandi uwushaka wese naze anywe ku mazi y’ubugingo ku buntu.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Ndaburiye umuntu wese yumva amajambo y’ubuvugishwa yo muri uwu muzingo w’igitabu: Nihagira uwugira ico yongeye ku vyanditswe muri uwu muzingo w’igitabu, Imana izokwongera ku vyago vyiwe, ivyago bicanditsemwo. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Kandi nihagira ico agabanije ku majambo y’ubuvugishwa ari muri uwu muzingo w’igitabu, Imana izomwaka umugabane wiwe ku giti c’ubugingo no mu Gisagara Cera vyavuzwe muri iki gitabu.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Uwushingira intahe ibi aravuga ati: <char style="wj">“Egome, ndaza vuba.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Amen. Kaze, Mwami Yesu.<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Ubuntu bw’Umwami Yesu bube kuri bose. Amen.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>